    app shows: the launch image `Splash` (IN-01's copy of client/tw.resources/ios/splash/Default@2x~universal~anyany.png)
    filling the screen with aspect fill over a white background (`SplashScreenBackgroundColor`, white). The app keeps
    the same image in `SplashView` until the migration has finished, as the Cordova splash stayed until the first view.
-->
